# Everything that is not code.
#
# data/ holds the signing key, the client register and the console password.
# None of it belongs in a repository — the key least of all, because a key that
# has been committed once is in the history forever, and the only way to undo
# it is to reissue every licence you have ever sold.
data/

# Belt and braces: no key file gets committed from anywhere in this tree, even
# if it is moved out of data/ by accident.
*.key
*.key.bak
*.pem
config.json
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm

*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
